{"schema_version":1,"batch_id":"screening-0083","screening_model":"gpt-5.6-luna","reasoning":"medium","prompt_version":"gauss-screening-v1","item_count":7,"subject":"math","topic_key":"probability","total_weight":112,"expected_output":"screening-0083.output.jsonl","items":[{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_1842","source_sha256":"5628530f1dfb21d055f6aa83780a83cf6a222d3103073851fb3181d35dd12c32","subject":"math","section_id":"math_discrete_data","source_topic_key":"probability","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"با حروف کلمهٔ PEYKAN یک کلمهٔ سه‌حرفی با حروف متمایز ساخته‌ایم. با کدام احتمال این کلمه شامل حرف K بوده ولی فاقد N است؟"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1842/stem_1.webp","alt":"صورت سوال 1842","aspect_ratio":0.032}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$\\dfrac{1}{2}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1842/option_1_2.webp","alt":"گزینه ۱","aspect_ratio":0.5321}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\dfrac{2}{5}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1842/option_2_3.webp","alt":"گزینه ۲","aspect_ratio":0.5321}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\dfrac{3}{10}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1842/option_3_4.webp","alt":"گزینه ۳","aspect_ratio":0.5321}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\dfrac{1}{5}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1842/option_4_5.webp","alt":"گزینه ۴","aspect_ratio":0.5321}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"در پیشامد $B$ ابتدا ۲ حرف از بین ۴ حرف PEYA انتخاب کرده سپس در جایگشت سه حرف انتخابی (همراه با حرف K) ضرب می‌کنیم.\n$P(B) = \\frac{\\binom{4}{2} \\times 3!}{\\binom{6}{3} \\times 3!} = \\frac{6}{20} = \\frac{3}{10}$\nمی‌توانستیم مسئله را بدون توجه به جایگشت حروف حل نماییم.\n$P(B) = \\frac{\\binom{4}{2}}{\\binom{6}{3}} = \\frac{6}{20} = 0/3$"}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1842/option_1_2.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1842/option_2_3.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1842/option_3_4.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1842/option_4_5.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1842/stem_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1842/option_1_2.webp","sha256":"0f761a89b1ebe0d5620fd1b76e169d1da9d4fa1b0af68327f62ea053cd242edf","bytes":1210},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1842/option_2_3.webp","sha256":"ea2e0d566bf1749c63fde37db517c0c96ca5945a85f7b0d02f2814c446cf5b7e","bytes":1108},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1842/option_3_4.webp","sha256":"2359167efc30f9c35a66f377b0188a7a96dda6dfd1ff6206cb429f41edd50c7d","bytes":1372},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1842/option_4_5.webp","sha256":"ebbef8f2412231d8052750acb4d25b3717bcc805c15cfe9db33595b83f1989ff","bytes":1456},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1842/stem_1.webp","sha256":"243991db2978f12e1e94037d5081d1ec0122a5871290668aec853e3d6c182e8a","bytes":6414}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":1842,"question_pdf":"16.pdf","question_page":11,"solution_page":170,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_1843","source_sha256":"e82beddae0d422f32b5aef31573c79c9868506d4626974c1b1a4b82001f4d487","subject":"math","section_id":"math_discrete_data","source_topic_key":"probability","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"با حروف کلمهٔ FANTEZI یک کلمهٔ پنج‌حرفی با حروف متمایز ساخته‌ایم. با کدام احتمال حداکثر ۲ حرف از حروف N ،A و F در این کلمه وجود دارد؟"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1843/stem_1.webp","alt":"صورت سوال 1843","aspect_ratio":0.0477}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$\\dfrac{2}{7}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1843/option_1_2.webp","alt":"گزینه ۱","aspect_ratio":0.5256}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\dfrac{3}{7}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1843/option_2_3.webp","alt":"گزینه ۲","aspect_ratio":0.5256}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\dfrac{4}{7}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1843/option_3_4.webp","alt":"گزینه ۳","aspect_ratio":0.5256}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\dfrac{5}{7}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1843/option_4_5.webp","alt":"گزینه ۴","aspect_ratio":0.5256}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"از روش متمم استفاده می‌کنیم.\n$P(B) = 1 - P(\\text{هر سه حرف FAN در کلمه باشد})$\n$= 1 - \\frac{\\binom{4}{2} \\times 5!}{\\binom{7}{5} \\times 5!} = 1 - \\frac{6}{21} = 1 - \\frac{2}{7} = \\frac{5}{7}$"}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1843/option_1_2.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1843/option_2_3.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1843/option_3_4.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1843/option_4_5.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1843/stem_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1843/option_1_2.webp","sha256":"f33d7553eda9bf4442ed87b57ad8373574177858ceab6a954990a2680e31b510","bytes":898},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1843/option_2_3.webp","sha256":"5c56c4d30155b9883913ded8b045b1aa3c06254c22b6015c516522a43b28df0c","bytes":862},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1843/option_3_4.webp","sha256":"6f03d483d7ca6b512ed465e11124c27cbc8586ab0170319759120a45f9f8d918","bytes":912},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1843/option_4_5.webp","sha256":"4bd56e1c56e0594dd619a1b0b8c67254d34fba74a14ec99329dfb64813b5be0c","bytes":906},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1843/stem_1.webp","sha256":"575d08cf8a9ef68026287ea955ec22864d16cd076f39932d19e5106b4b6aecd6","bytes":18744}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":1843,"question_pdf":"16.pdf","question_page":11,"solution_page":170,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_1844","source_sha256":"071fd8768e1ded604f4fa05d2b622943fe054cbee122bdabc10dca191a3dc576","subject":"math","section_id":"math_discrete_data","source_topic_key":"probability","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"عدد k را به تصادف از بین اعداد طبیعی یک‌رقمی انتخاب می‌کنیم. با کدام احتمال نمودار سهمی $y = kx^2 + 10x + k$ همواره بالای محور طول‌ها است؟"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1844/stem_1.webp","alt":"صورت سوال 1844","aspect_ratio":0.0458}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$\\dfrac{1}{3}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1844/option_1_2.webp","alt":"گزینه ۱","aspect_ratio":0.5256}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\dfrac{4}{9}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1844/option_2_3.webp","alt":"گزینه ۲","aspect_ratio":0.5256}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\dfrac{5}{9}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1844/option_3_4.webp","alt":"گزینه ۳","aspect_ratio":0.5256}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\dfrac{2}{3}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1844/option_4_5.webp","alt":"گزینه ۴","aspect_ratio":0.5256}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"برای این‌که سهمی $y = kx^2 + 10x + k$ بالای محور طول‌ها باشد باید $\\Delta < 0$ و $k > 0$ باشد.\n$\\Delta < 0 \\Rightarrow 100 - 4k^2 < 0 \\Rightarrow k^2 > 25$\n$\\xrightarrow{k > 0} k > 5 \\xrightarrow[k < 10]{k \\in \\mathbb{N}} k \\in \\{6, 7, 8, 9\\}$\nاگر پیشامد مورد نظر را $A$ بنامیم، خواهیم داشت:\n$P(A) = \\frac{n(A)}{n(S)} = \\frac{4}{9}$"}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1844/option_1_2.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1844/option_2_3.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1844/option_3_4.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1844/option_4_5.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1844/stem_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1844/option_1_2.webp","sha256":"bf1e082c079f76f51f9fa55d2ea219a7743e9424080ad9ce9d2ba1e238ff7533","bytes":748},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1844/option_2_3.webp","sha256":"37cf691b8c961b820b49e316b98f040209e4261e378fda016e7339b54fe0016f","bytes":884},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1844/option_3_4.webp","sha256":"4f3f4fe828bc52d763cc7d3647998bc814d2ab56ba5ec18e394d2f2293233551","bytes":918},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1844/option_4_5.webp","sha256":"3c8e022fb376bee80cabb1826d82eb21d07da906450fe21ec3de3a2c3df7b29f","bytes":890},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1844/stem_1.webp","sha256":"643eed4759aa87cdc5ba4b3b890227c91012f2b51d5faa0942f88c53e004f028","bytes":10704}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":1844,"question_pdf":"16.pdf","question_page":11,"solution_page":170,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_1845","source_sha256":"5861517884ddec9f1ab55b72e481a515328522d8b837f7c0502c0cef2c9e8d91","subject":"math","section_id":"math_discrete_data","source_topic_key":"probability","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"از بین اعداد سه‌رقمی یک عدد به تصادف انتخاب می‌کنیم. احتمال آن‌که این عدد شامل رقم ۲ باشد، چه‌قدر بیشتر از آن است که شامل رقم صفر باشد؟"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1845/stem_1.webp","alt":"صورت سوال 1845","aspect_ratio":0.0448}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"صفر"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1845/option_1_2.webp","alt":"گزینه ۱","aspect_ratio":0.5256}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\dfrac{5}{81}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1845/option_2_3.webp","alt":"گزینه ۲","aspect_ratio":0.5256}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\dfrac{2}{27}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1845/option_3_4.webp","alt":"گزینه ۳","aspect_ratio":0.5256}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\dfrac{7}{81}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1845/option_4_5.webp","alt":"گزینه ۴","aspect_ratio":0.5256}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"پیشامد آن‌که عدد سه‌رقمی شامل ۲ باشد را $A$ و پیشامد آن‌که شامل صفر باشد را $B$ می‌نامیم.\n$P(A) = 1 - P(A') = 1 - \\frac{8 \\times 8 \\times 7}{9 \\times 9 \\times 8} = 1 - \\frac{56}{81} = \\frac{25}{81}$\n$P(B) = 1 - P(B') = 1 - \\frac{9 \\times 8 \\times 7}{9 \\times 9 \\times 8} = 1 - \\frac{7}{9} = \\frac{2}{9}$\nبنابراین:\n$P(A) - P(B) = \\frac{25}{81} - \\frac{2}{9} = \\frac{25 - 18}{81} = \\frac{7}{81}$"}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1845/option_1_2.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1845/option_2_3.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1845/option_3_4.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1845/option_4_5.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1845/stem_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1845/option_1_2.webp","sha256":"0d1329d7d2c34508578a870132df12298411ee232e646e9a6ed147f3380965e3","bytes":1560},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1845/option_2_3.webp","sha256":"5d5bb0b5f933ae94e15769aa2c9707690094c70ee600520d5e2d078073c4c644","bytes":1098},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1845/option_3_4.webp","sha256":"95263526dd0249a8faafe90fb8274f59ab7e92dca269f63fe81e08aa51f334b1","bytes":1480},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1845/option_4_5.webp","sha256":"af2088b7d0d3045e4a436247402bf94199be4a99ab3a2d596e9c115474b4ff83","bytes":1582},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1845/stem_1.webp","sha256":"c556b08bd4f65cf96967f2405f10ab5f4e3c65fa1e285b2facf16424169967d0","bytes":10940}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":1845,"question_pdf":"16.pdf","question_page":11,"solution_page":170,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_1846","source_sha256":"8a7bb168bbc42427ebfb95b2dd6ef00b2ee03310e54d98c032ff76bbf91d8858","subject":"math","section_id":"math_discrete_data","source_topic_key":"probability","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"ارقام ۱، ۲، ۳، ۴ و ۵ را بر روی ۵ کارت متمایز می‌نویسیم. با قراردادن تصادفی کارت‌ها کنار یکدیگر با چه احتمالی عدد ۳۴۱ در این عدد ۵رقمی دیده می‌شود؟"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1846/stem_1.webp","alt":"صورت سوال 1846","aspect_ratio":0.0468}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$\\dfrac{1}{20}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1846/option_1_2.webp","alt":"گزینه ۱","aspect_ratio":0.5256}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\dfrac{3}{20}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1846/option_2_3.webp","alt":"گزینه ۲","aspect_ratio":0.5256}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\dfrac{1}{10}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1846/option_3_4.webp","alt":"گزینه ۳","aspect_ratio":0.5256}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\dfrac{3}{10}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1846/option_4_5.webp","alt":"گزینه ۴","aspect_ratio":0.5256}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"پیشامد مورد نظر را $A$ می‌نامیم. ارقام ۳، ۴ و ۱ را به صورت (۳۴۱) به یکدیگر می‌بندیم و آن را به صورت یک عدد در نظر می‌گیریم. در این حالت سه عدد ۲، ۵، (۳۴۱) در اختیار داریم که جایگشت آن‌ها $3!$ است. بنابراین:\n$P(A) = \\frac{n(A)}{n(S)} = \\frac{3!}{5!} = \\frac{1}{20}$"}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1846/option_1_2.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1846/option_2_3.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1846/option_3_4.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1846/option_4_5.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1846/stem_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1846/option_1_2.webp","sha256":"bfcd6b2f6c9acbffe5f8a155c5987e295276574c097157ba