,"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"پیشامد مورد نظر را $A$ می‌نامیم. برای این‌که عدد سه‌رقمی مضرب ۵ باشد، یکان آن باید صفر یا ۵ می‌باشد.\n(یکان ۵ باشد) $\\to \\underline{4} \\times \\underline{4} \\times \\underline{1} = 16$\n(یکان صفر باشد) $\\to \\underline{5} \\times \\underline{4} \\times \\underline{1} = 20$\n$\\Rightarrow n(A) = 16 + 20 = 36$\nدر نتیجه:\n$P(A) = \\frac{n(A)}{n(S)} = \\frac{36}{5 \\times 5 \\times 4} = 0/36$"}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1847/option_1_2.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1847/option_2_3.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1847/option_3_4.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1847/option_4_5.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1847/stem_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1847/option_1_2.webp","sha256":"6ef06a37cd550b2619809ac6d0fcd74cc442cedc345a0044ba0b05a7ef8a4b3f","bytes":672},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1847/option_2_3.webp","sha256":"8a753ead573811b3daadb26da74ab283395a326141e37e1d6e62ee6bf25e4f55","bytes":626},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1847/option_3_4.webp","sha256":"fb7d5edb913bbf8dce6dbf34927af6b60d7d797269ea411f7a98dba0f732267d","bytes":626},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1847/option_4_5.webp","sha256":"723cc51aa15bb42786106bdf65cee26616acbf79b2adcdcce339327bea7c4a16","bytes":700},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1847/stem_1.webp","sha256":"d148dee8ccdffc9ef62115e24a44390032078770ae549f2b92185fc261ebcf0e","bytes":5762}],"provenance":{"edition":"nardebam_1405","question_number":1847,"question_pdf":"16.pdf","question_page":11,"solution_page":170,"solution_origin":"source"},"source_answer_hidden":true},{"question_id":"nardebam_math_1405_1848","source_sha256":"c202483236b71f631cd0c63ebb2768922abc6608ff7546472bb96e3ac31eff54","subject":"math","section_id":"math_discrete_data","source_topic_key":"probability","source_difficulty":"hard","stem":[{"type":"text","text":"با ارقام ۰، ۱، ۲، ۳ و ۴ یک عدد سه‌رقمی با ارقام متمایز نوشته‌ایم. با چه احتمالی ارقام این عدد از چپ به راست نزولی است؟"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1848/stem_1.webp","alt":"صورت سوال 1848","aspect_ratio":0.0315}],"options":[[{"type":"text","text":"$\\dfrac{1}{8}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1848/option_1_2.webp","alt":"گزینه ۱","aspect_ratio":0.5256}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\dfrac{1}{6}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1848/option_2_3.webp","alt":"گزینه ۲","aspect_ratio":0.5256}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\dfrac{5}{24}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1848/option_3_4.webp","alt":"گزینه ۳","aspect_ratio":0.5256}],[{"type":"text","text":"$\\dfrac{1}{4}$"},{"type":"image","asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1848/option_4_5.webp","alt":"گزینه ۴","aspect_ratio":0.5256}]],"solution":[{"type":"text","text":"پیشامد مورد نظر را $A$ می‌نامیم. با انتخاب هر سه رقم از پنج رقم موجود تنها یک عدد سه‌رقمی می‌توان نوشت که ارقام آن از چپ به راست نزولی باشد. بنابراین:\n$P(A) = \\frac{n(A)}{n(S)} = \\frac{\\binom{5}{3}}{4 \\times 4 \\times 3} = \\frac{10}{48} = \\frac{5}{24}$"}],"smart_shortcut":null,"media_assets":["question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1848/option_1_2.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1848/option_2_3.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1848/option_3_4.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1848/option_4_5.webp","question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1848/stem_1.webp"],"media_evidence":[{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1848/option_1_2.webp","sha256":"806a6414e82bfb4211ec2b7eccebad1984554446ce6e1addb9a05ce750b8732e","bytes":1110},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardebam_math_1405_1848/option_2_3.webp","sha256":"b0f999d6b8c80646bf7d048f595d8d3dda885c4e9f6c2c5653ad545f2ce42076","bytes":888},{"asset":"question_media/math/nardeb